  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "過去ah "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</b><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Âng Ek-sim&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（台羅會秘書長）</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">本專欄「台羅會交流道」ê稿由台灣羅馬字協會提供kap校對，編輯部無koh做文字編輯。</span></b></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">70幾冬ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tāi-chì已經過去</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Hō͘ 靈魂安歇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Mài koh講過去ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">有人án-ne講</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tāi-chì kám有真正過--khì</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">靈魂kám有真正安歇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">威權ê幽靈iáu tī空中飛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">公義iáu bōe醒</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">228造成ê傷害</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kám真正有過--khì</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">傷痕iáu teh脹膿</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">被害者ê kiáⁿ-sun mā是受害者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Iáu bōe得著道歉kap補償</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Án-ne kám有算過--khí</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">加害者ê繼承人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">刀iau攑tī手--nih</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Iáu teh享受榮耀</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Án-ne kám算過--khí</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">無反省</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">加害者ê繼承人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">竟然享受民主</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Iáu teh利用民主蹧躂民主</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">民主前輩</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">流汗、流血、流目屎</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">甚至失去性命爭取ê民主</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Án-ne hông踳踏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">無是非</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">拍輸走贏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Iáu敢講因為in ê保護</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣才無hō͘ 中共the̍h--khì</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Thâi 台灣人ê tāi-chì beh án-chóaⁿ算</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣囡仔被迫做兵</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">去死tī金門異鄉</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">保護流亡者kám免算</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">無廉恥</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">為反共大陸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">停留30冬無建設</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">竟然敢講</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣ê發展是in創造--ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">咱比較--chi̍t-ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">戰敗ê日本</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">地下鐵已經4層</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">咱才開始10大建設</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣人ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kám beh相信</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">威權ê幽靈已經過去ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kám beh相信</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">冤死ê靈魂ē-tàng安歇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kám beh繼續hō͘ hia人蹧躂</span></p><div><br /></div><p>--------------</p><h3>#台灣羅馬字協會</h3><p>（簡稱「台羅會」）簡介：</p><p>2001年成立，宗旨：</p><p>(1)推行台灣羅馬字ê研究kap普遍化。</p><p>(2)追認台灣羅馬字kap台灣話ê法定地位。</p><p>(3)要求政府實施公平正義ê多語文政策。</p><p>(4)建設多元、開放、互相尊重ê台灣文化。</p><p>E-mail：tlhemail@gmail.com&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>網站http://www.tlh.org.tw</p><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgBovshtz-ZPg2uAGuilKjtg9j5AtcQX3p_Xs6hTiCOpB79fcCylUL7PjPFKKaAg30rTk_rYjD93CJcvSSf7Iev7ZSehM1BmVfcnnAZGq5zvWrESKxbxYHGBcnwcwvsHuHfkhatISB0yLv219-r5OdYNX02m9WvprbcEdBmvqA3Z_BoWPM5mCTuCt-RQQ=s1421\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgBovshtz-ZPg2uAGuilKjtg9j5AtcQX3p_Xs6hTiCOpB79fcCylUL7PjPFKKaAg30rTk_rYjD93CJcvSSf7Iev7ZSehM1BmVfcnnAZGq5zvWrESKxbxYHGBcnwcwvsHuHfkhatISB0yLv219-r5OdYNX02m9WvprbcEdBmvqA3Z_BoWPM5mCTuCt-RQQ=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh5GwbWDXyKAOTdu-B7Z3SX3lmd80V5G94ZPiQdfz5DK6Yonssupn1mJ9A5gAU00xD4_5MgP0hA-O6qsfooDTlLfPjCjhZJW3oFIhU4TSCnAZcZYGAc4CVjR-ZDUgb-uovVsD6rSudlbte7JyjIdv3NhD3tPfg91-zzG-JP3iSVNHxsD3FCqeoKnOWzGA/s4300/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1335%E6%9C%9F_044_045.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"4300\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh5GwbWDXyKAOTdu-B7Z3SX3lmd80V5G94ZPiQdfz5DK6Yonssupn1mJ9A5gAU00xD4_5MgP0hA-O6qsfooDTlLfPjCjhZJW3oFIhU4TSCnAZcZYGAc4CVjR-ZDUgb-uovVsD6rSudlbte7JyjIdv3NhD3tPfg91-zzG-JP3iSVNHxsD3FCqeoKnOWzGA/w640-h452/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1335%E6%9C%9F_044_045.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div></div><div><br /></div><div><di